m risen, I will go before you into Galilee.", "words": [[0, 195308], [4, 195411], [10, 195691], [15, 195911], [17, 196131], [20, 196251], [27, 196931], [29, 197091], [34, 197231], [37, 197371], [44, 197711], [48, 197951], [53, 198151]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 199134, "end": 203352, "text": "But Peter said to him, Although all shall be offended, yet will not I.", "words": [[0, 199134], [4, 199279], [10, 199539], [15, 199839], [18, 200039], [23, 200551], [32, 200792], [36, 201112], [42, 201352], [45, 201512], [55, 202252], [59, 202412], [64, 202692], [68, 202912]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 203702, "end": 211953, "text": "And Jesus says to him, Assuredly I say to you, That this day, even in this night, before the rooster crow twice, you shall deny me three times.", "words": [[0, 203702], [4, 203848], [10, 204148], [15, 204488], [18, 204728], [23, 205308], [33, 205868], [35, 206008], [39, 206188], [42, 206368], [47, 206888], [52, 207108], [57, 207328], [62, 207768], [67, 207948], [70, 208108], [75, 208268], [82, 208728], [89, 208948], [93, 209148], [101, 209448], [106, 209668], [113, 210428], [117, 210488], [123, 210668], [128, 210948], [131, 211128], [137, 211348]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 212303, "end": 220082, "text": "But he spoke the more vehemently, If I should die with you, I will not deny you in any wise. Likewise also said they all.", "words": [[0, 212303], [4, 212404], [7, 212504], [13, 212764], [17, 212984], [22, 213204], [34, 214248], [37, 214428], [39, 214608], [46, 214848], [50, 215148], [55, 215368], [60, 215888], [62, 216048], [67, 216188], [71, 216408], [76, 216768], [80, 216988], [83, 217128], [87, 217523], [93, 218206], [102, 218569], [107, 219049], [112, 219369], [117, 219609]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 220532, "end": 227406, "text": "And they came to a place which was named Gethsemane: and he says to his disciples, Sit here, while I shall pray.", "words": [[0, 220532], [4, 220650], [9, 220750], [14, 220970], [17, 221150], [19, 221270], [25, 221510], [31, 221770], [35, 221950], [41, 222636], [53, 223562], [57, 223708], [60, 223788], [65, 224008], [68, 224228], [72, 224348], [83, 225390], [87, 225630], [93, 226030], [99, 226330], [101, 226610], [107, 226830]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 227756, "end": 234056, "text": "And he takes with him Peter and James and John, and began to be greatly amazed, and to be very heavy;", "words": [[0, 227756], [4, 227889], [7, 227989], [13, 228209], [18, 228509], [22, 228669], [28, 229029], [32, 229349], [38, 229689], [42, 229949], [48, 230289], [52, 230889], [58, 231249], [61, 231429], [64, 231589], [72, 231929], [80, 232429], [84, 232909], [87, 233069], [90, 233209], [95, 233529]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 234506, "end": 240135, "text": "And says to them, My soul is exceeding sorrowful to death: stay here, and watch.", "words": [[0, 234506], [4, 234652], [9, 234872], [12, 235092], [18, 235784], [21, 235968], [26, 236348], [29, 236588], [39, 237128], [49, 237688], [52, 237848], [59, 238565], [64, 238808], [70, 239188], [74, 239568]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 240485, "end": 246726, "text": "And he went forward a little, and fell on the ground, and prayed that, if it were possible, the hour might pass from him.", "words": [[0, 240485], [4, 240604], [7, 240704], [12, 240884], [20, 241244], [22, 241464], [30, 241664], [34, 241964], [39, 242204], [42, 242384], [46, 242504], [54, 242844], [58, 243204], [65, 243504], [71, 243784], [74, 243984], [77, 244084], [82, 244204], [92, 245164], [96, 245284], [101, 245564], [107, 245824], [112, 246164], [117, 246384]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 247176, "end": 255359, "text": "And he said, Abba, Father, all things are possible to you; take away this cup from me: nevertheless not what I will, but what you will.", "words": [[0, 247176], [4, 247340], [7, 247400], [13, 248114], [19, 248375], [27, 249075], [31, 249275], [38, 249555], [42, 249715], [51, 250075], [54, 250315], [59, 250941], [64, 251045], [69, 251265], [74, 251485], [78, 251705], [83, 251885], [87, 252501], [100, 253081], [104, 253261], [109, 253461], [111, 253621], [117, 254341], [121, 254441], [126, 254641], [130, 254901]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 255709, "end": 261737, "text": "And he comes, and finds them sleeping, and says to Peter, Simon, do you sleep? could you not watch one hour?", "words": [[0, 255709], [4, 255845], [7, 255945], [14, 256225], [18, 256445], [24, 256745], [29, 256925], [39, 257345], [43, 257785], [48, 258005], [51, 258225], [58, 258946], [65, 259491], [68, 259491], [72, 259591], [79, 260400], [85, 260503], [89, 260623], [93, 260783], [99, 261023], [103, 261263]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 262187, "end": 267596, "text": "Watch and pray, lest you enter into temptation. The spirit truly is ready, but the flesh is weak.", "words": [[0, 262187], [6, 262386], [10, 262586], [16, 262826], [21, 263146], [25, 263266], [31, 263506], [36, 263746], [48, 264851], [52, 265126], [59, 265446], [65, 265786], [68, 266006], [75, 266506], [79, 266606], [83, 266726], [89, 266986], [92, 267126]]}, {"verse": 39, "start": 267946, "end": 271339, "text": "And again he went away, and prayed, and spoke the same words.", "words": [[0, 267946], [4, 268101], [10, 268321], [13, 268541], [18, 268721], [24, 269061], [28, 269301], [36, 269681], [40, 269941], [46, 270241], [50, 270461], [55, 270721]]}, {"verse": 40, "start": 271789, "end": 277205, "text": "And when he returned, he found them asleep again, (for their eyes were heavy,) neither knew they what to answer him.", "words": [[0, 271789], [4, 271913], [9, 272053], [12, 272193], [22, 272673], [25, 272873], [31, 273133], [36, 273333], [43, 273653], [50, 274193], [55, 274313], [61, 274493], [66, 274773], [71, 274973], [79, 275593], [87, 275793], [92, 276053], [97, 276193], [102, 276373], [105, 276493], [112, 276793]]}, {"verse": 41, "start": 277655, "end": 288955, "text": "And he comes the third time, and says to them, Sleep on now, and take your rest: it is enough, the hour is come; behold, the Son of man is betrayed into the hands of sinners.", "words": [[0, 277655], [4, 277788], [7, 277908], [13, 278168], [17, 278388], [23, 278648], [29, 279008], [33, 279608], [38, 279828], [41, 280068], [47, 280703], [53, 280945], [56, 281205], [61, 281465], [65, 281865], [70, 282065], [75, 282225], [81, 283079], [84, 283196], [87, 283316], [95, 283996], [99, 284096], [104, 284376], [107, 284656], [113, 285436], [121, 286141], [125, 286301], [129, 286541], [132, 286641], [136, 286901], [139, 287081], [148, 287501], [153, 287781], [157, 287921], [163, 288181], [166, 288321]]}, {"verse": 42, "start": 289405, "end": 293527, "text": "Rise up, let us go; lo, he that betrays me is at hand.", "words": [[0, 289405], [5, 289642], [9, 290282], [13, 290382], [16, 290522], [20, 291367], [24, 291497], [27, 291757], [32, 291937], [40, 292497], [43, 292637], [46, 292897], [49, 293037]]}, {"verse": 43, "start": 293877, "end": 305132, "text": "¶ And immediately, while he yet spoke, comes Judas, one of the twelve, and with him a great multitude with swords and staves, from the chief priests and the scribes and the elders.", "words": [[2, 293877], [6, 294007], [19, 294387], [25, 294907], [28, 295127], [32, 295327], [39, 295707], [45, 296327], [52, 297087], [56, 297227], [59, 297347], [63, 297467], [71, 298327], [75, 298507], [80, 298707], [84, 298887], [86, 299027], [92, 299287], [102, 299867], [107, 300267], [114, 300647], [118, 300887], [126, 301866], [131, 302025], [135, 302145], [141, 302385], [149, 302845], [153, 303225], [157, 303385], [165, 303905], [169, 304025], [173, 304125]]}, {"verse": 44, "start": 305582, "end": 314745, "text": "And he that betrayed him had given them a token, saying, Whomsoever I shall kiss, that same is he; take him, and lead him away safely.", "words": [[0, 305582], [4, 305718], [7, 305938], [12, 306158], [21, 306478], [25, 306858], [29, 307038], [35, 307278], [40, 307518], [42, 307658], [49, 308258], [57, 310150], [68, 310663], [70, 310923], [76, 311083], [82, 311763], [87, 311863], [92, 312123], [95, 312263], [99, 312888], [104, 313048], [109, 313288], [113, 313628], [118, 313828], [122, 313968], [127, 314208]]}, {"verse": 45, "start": 315095, "end": 321959, "text": "And as soon as he was come, he goes immediately to him, and says, Master, master; and kissed him.", "words": [[0, 315095], [4, 315227], [7, 315367], [12, 315567], [15, 315687], [18, 315767], [22, 315927], [28, 316527], [31, 316607], [36, 316807], [48, 317247], [51, 317627], [56, 317827], [60, 318007], [66, 319569], [74, 320108], [82, 321069], [86, 321231], [93, 321531]]}, {"verse": 46, "start": 322409, "end": 324722, "text": "¶ And they laid their hands on him, and took him.", "words": [[2, 322409], [6, 322547], [11, 322687], [16, 322907], [22, 323147], [28, 323427], [31, 323687], [36, 323887], [40, 324127], [45, 324347]]}, {"verse": 47, "start": 325172, "end": 331675, "text": "And one of them that stood by drew a sword, and struck a servant of the high priest, and cut off his ear.", "words": [[0, 325172], [4, 325324], [8, 325524], [11, 325684], [16, 325924], [21, 326104], [27, 326364], [30, 326724], [35, 327104], [37, 327344], [44, 327684], [48, 328244], [55, 328524], [57, 328724], [65, 329024], [68, 329244], [72, 329384], [77, 329584], [85, 329964], [89, 330564], [93, 330824], [97, 331004], [101, 331224]]}, {"verse": 48, "start": 332125, "end": 338857, "text": "And Jesus answered and said to them, Are you come out, as against a thief, with swords and with staves to take me?", "words": [[0, 332125], [4, 332540], [10, 332880], [19, 333420], [23, 333660], [28, 333860], [31, 334040], [37, 334693], [41, 334795], [45, 334915], [50, 335115], [55, 335435], [58, 335895], [66, 336175], [68, 336415], [75, 336675], [80, 336995], [87, 337415], [91, 337615], [96, 337755], [103, 338175], [106, 338335], [111, 338515]]}, {"verse": 49, "start": 339307, "end": 344445, "text": "I was daily with you in the temple teaching, and you took me not: but the scriptures must be fulfilled.", "words": [[0, 339307], [2, 339411], [6, 339551], [12, 339831], [17, 340111], [21, 340231], [24, 340351], [28, 340451], [35, 340691], [45, 341051], [49, 341591], [53, 341691], [58, 341851], [61, 342011], [66, 342756], [70, 342835], [74, 342955], [85, 343295], [90, 343635], [93, 343855]]}, {"verse": 50, "start": 344795, "end": 346888, "text": "And they all forsook him, and fled.", "words": [[0, 344795], [4, 344927], [9, 345087], [13, 345307], [21, 345867], [26, 346007], [30, 346287]]}, {"verse": 51, "start": 347338, "end": 355504, "text": "And there followed him a certain young man, having a linen cloth cast about his naked body; and the young men laid hold on him:", "words": [[0, 347338], [4, 347678], [10, 347798], [19, 348158], [23, 348418], [25, 348578], [33, 348778], [39, 349058], [44, 349718], [51, 349938], [53, 350118], [59, 350318], [65, 350698], [70, 351118], [76, 351458], [80, 351678], [86, 351998], [92, 352910], [96, 353241], [100, 353361], [106, 353561], [110, 353821], [115, 354081], [120, 354381], [123, 354661]]}, {"verse": 52, "start": 355954, "end": 359465, "text": "And he left the linen cloth, and fled from them naked.", "words": [[0, 355954], [4, 356089], [7, 356209], [12, 356509], [16, 356729], [22, 356969], [29, 357429], [33, 358109], [38, 358389], [43, 358669], [48, 358869]]}, {"verse": 53, "start": 359915, "end": 367405, "text": "¶ And they led Jesus away to the high priest: and with him were assembled all the chief priests and the elders and the scribes.", "words": [[2, 359915], [6, 360059], [11, 360179], [15, 360399], [21, 360779], [26, 361219], [29, 361439], [33, 361579], [38, 361759], [46, 362722], [50, 362856], [55, 363076], [59, 363276], [64, 363496], [74, 363896], [78, 364356], [82, 364536], [88, 364816], [96, 365276], [100, 365736], [104, 365856], [111, 366216], [115, 366556], [119, 366676]]}, {"verse": 54, "start": 367855, "end": 376015, "text": "And Peter followed him afar off, even into the palace of the high priest: and he sat with the servants, and warmed himself at the fire.", "words": [[0, 367855], [4, 367983], [10, 368263], [19, 368703], [23, 368983], [28, 369363], [33, 369923], [38, 370143], [43, 370423], [47, 370583], [54, 370923], [57, 371203], [61, 371343], [66, 371503], [74, 372428], [78, 372564], [81, 372664], [85, 372964], [90, 373204], [94, 373364], [104, 373744], [108, 374404], [115, 374704], [123, 375124], [126, 375344], [130, 375444]]}, {"verse": 55, "start": 376465, "end": 382817, "text": "And the chief priests and all the council sought for witness against Jesus to put him to death; and found none.", "words": [[0, 376465], [4, 376738], [8, 376838], [14, 377078], [22, 377518], [26, 377838], [30, 378078], [34, 378318], [42, 378558], [49, 378918], [53, 379138], [61, 379398], [69, 379798], [75, 380218], [78, 380458], [82, 380638], [86, 380758], [89, 380898], [96, 381734], [100, 381851], [106, 382111]]}, {"verse": 56, "start": 383267, "end": 387829, "text": "For many bore false witness against him, but their witness agreed not together.", "words": [[0, 383267], [4, 383363], [9, 383643], [14, 383943], [20, 384343], [28, 384663], [36, 385023], [41, 385683], [45, 385903], [51, 386063], [59, 386403], [66, 386883], [70, 387163]]}, {"verse": 57, "start": 388279, "end": 392821, "text": "And there arose certain, and bore false witness against him, saying,", "words": [[0, 388279], [4, 388408], [10, 388588], [16, 388888], [25, 389348], [29, 389868], [34, 390128], [40, 390488], [48, 390788], [56, 391108], [61, 391488]]}, {"verse": 58, "start": 393071, "end": 399557, "text": "We heard him say, I will destroy this temple that is made with hands, and within three days I will build another made without hands.", "words": [[0, 393071], [3, 393174], [9, 393394], [13, 393514], [18, 394094], [20, 394274], [25, 394414], [33, 394834], [38, 395094], [45, 395414], [50, 395594], [53, 395714], [58, 395874], [63, 396054], [70, 396714], [74, 396794], [81, 397034], [87, 397314], [92, 397574], [94, 397874], [99, 397994], [105, 398194], [113, 398434], [118, 398734], [126, 398994]]}, {"verse": 59, "start": 399907, "end": 402575, "text": "But neither so did their witness agree together.", "words": [[0, 399907], [4, 400063], [12, 400443], [15, 400863], [19, 401083], [25, 401283], [33, 401583], [39, 401943]]}, {"verse": 60, "start": 403025, "end": 411078, "text": "And the high priest stood up in the midst, and asked Jesus, saying, Do you answer nothing? what is it which these witness against you?", "words": [[0, 403025], [4, 403154], [8, 403254], [13, 403454], [20, 403814], [26, 404234], [29, 404414], [32, 404534], [36, 404614], [43, 404874], [47, 405114], [53, 405354], [60, 405994], [68, 407438], [71, 407537], [75, 407657], [82, 407997], [91, 408953], [96, 409135], [99, 409335], [102, 409475], [108, 409695], [114, 409955], [122, 410315], [130, 410715]]}, {"verse": 61, "start": 411428, "end": 420763, "text": "But he kept silent, and answered nothing. Again the high priest asked him, and said to him, Are you the Christ, the Son of the Blessed?", "words": [[0, 411428], [4, 411632], [7, 411732], [12, 411972], [20, 412472], [24, 412932], [33, 413272], [42, 414218], [48, 414678], [52, 414878], [57, 415078], [64, 415398], [70, 415838], [75, 416078], [79, 416338], [84, 416578], [87, 416778], [92, 418496], [96, 418627], [100, 418767], [104, 418887], [112, 419687], [116, 419747], [120, 419987], [123, 420087], [127, 420187]]}, {"verse": 62, "start": 421113, "end": 429222, "text": "And Jesus said, I am: and you shall see the Son of man sitting on the right hand of power, and coming in the clouds of heaven.", "words": [[0, 421113], [4, 421236], [10, 421556], [16, 422482], [18, 422786], [22, 423671], [26, 423792], [30, 423952], [36, 424152], [40, 424372], [44, 424512], [48, 424752], [51, 424892], [55, 425192], [63, 425572], [66, 425792], [70, 425912], [76, 426132], [81, 426392], [84, 426572], [91, 426972], [95, 427532], [102, 427832], [105, 428032], [109, 428152], [116, 428532], [119, 428732]]}, {"verse": 63, "start": 429572, "end": 434664, "text": "Then the high priest tore his clothes, and says, What need we any further witnesses?", "words": [[0, 429572], [5, 429834], [9, 430014], [14, 430214], [21, 430514], [26, 430854], [30, 431054], [39, 431454], [43, 432034], [49, 432856], [54, 433017], [59, 433197], [62, 433397], [66, 433617], [74, 433897]]}, {"verse": 64, "start": 435114, "end": 440063, "text": "You have heard the blasphemy: what do you think? And they all condemned him to be guilty of death.", "words": [[0, 435114], [4, 435236], [9, 435336], [15, 435536], [19, 435676], [30, 436549], [35, 436712], [38, 436832], [42, 436912], [49, 437652], [53, 437795], [58, 437915], [62, 438095], [72, 438455], [76, 438755], [79, 438895], [82, 439055], [89, 439355], [92, 439615]]}, {"verse": 65, "start": 440513, "end": 450261, "text": "And some began to spit on him, and to cover his face, and to buffet him, and to say to him, Prophesy: and the servants did strike him with the palms of their hands.", "words": [[0, 440513], [4, 440657], [9, 440917], [15, 441277], [18, 441497], [23, 441757], [26, 441977], [31, 442237], [35, 442717], [38, 442857], [44, 443137], [48, 443417], [54, 443717], [58, 444037], [61, 444197], [68, 444477], [73, 444837], [77, 444997], [80, 445157], [84, 445337], [87, 445557], [92, 446510], [102, 447116], [106, 447248], [110, 447368], [119, 447688], [123, 448048], [130, 448408], [134, 448668], [139, 448848], [143, 448968], [149, 449248], [152, 449448], [158, 449588]]}, {"verse": 66, "start": 450711, "end": 455405, "text": "¶ And as Peter was beneath in the palace, there comes one of the maids of the high priest:", "words": [[2, 450711], [6, 450855], [9, 450975], [15, 451215], [19, 451455], [27, 451775], [30, 452015], [34, 452115], [42, 452935], [48, 453055], [54, 453315], [58, 453595], [61, 453695], [65, 453835], [71, 454255], [74, 454375], [78, 454495], [83, 454715]]}, {"verse": 67, "start": 455855, "end": 463313, "text": "And when she saw Peter warming himself, she looked upon him, and said, And you also were with Jesus of Nazareth.", "words": [[0, 455855], [4, 455989], [9, 456109], [13, 456289], [17, 456549], [23, 456829], [31, 457209], [40, 458109], [44, 458349], [51, 458569], [56, 458809], [61, 459109], [65, 459349], [71, 460052], [75, 460232], [79, 460392], [84, 460852], [89, 461152], [94, 461372], [100, 461752], [103, 462032]]}, {"verse": 68, "start": 463663, "end": 471425, "text": "But he denied, saying, I know not, neither understand I what you say. And he went out into the porch; and the rooster crew.", "words": [[0, 463663], [4, 463788], [7, 463868], [15, 464168], [23, 465140], [25, 465335], [30, 465655], [35, 466115], [43, 466495], [54, 467035], [56, 467295], [61, 467475], [65, 467635], [70, 468476], [74, 468608], [77, 468688], [82, 468868], [86, 469068], [91, 469328], [95, 469488], [102, 470388], [106, 470515], [110, 470595], [118, 470915]]}, {"verse": 69, "start": 471875, "end": 478610, "text": "And a maid saw him again, and began to say to them that stood by, This is one of them.", "words": [[0, 471875], [4, 472020], [6, 472100], [11, 472400], [15, 472740], [19, 472940], [26, 473320], [30, 473780], [36, 474080], [39, 474300], [43, 474480], [46, 474620], [51, 474800], [56, 475000], [62, 475220], [66, 476044], [71, 476276], [74, 476556], [78, 476816], [81, 476976]]}, {"verse": 70, "start": 478960, "end": 487939, "text": "And he denied it again. And a little after, they that stood by said again to Peter, Surely you are one of them: for you are a Galilaean, and your speech agrees to it.", "words": [[0, 478960], [4, 479098], [7, 479218], [14, 479538], [17, 479758], [24, 480615], [28, 480774], [30, 480854], [37, 481034], [44, 481454], [49, 481694], [54, 481834], [60, 482114], [63, 482494], [68, 482814], [74, 483094], [77, 483254], [84, 484056], [91, 484313], [95, 484553], [99, 484673], [103, 484913], [106, 485073], [112, 485629], [116, 485737], [120, 485897], [124, 486017], [126, 486337], [137, 486657], [141, 486837], [146, 486957], [153, 487217], [160, 487517], [163, 487797]]}, {"verse": 71, "start": 488289, "end": 493761, "text": "But he began to curse and to swear, saying, I know not this man of whom you speak.", "words": [[0, 488289], [4, 488376], [7, 488476], [13, 488796], [16, 488956], [22, 489256], [26, 489496], [29, 489656], [36, 490176], [44, 491524], [46, 491644], [51, 492184], [55, 492384], [60, 492644], [64, 492844], [67, 492984], [72, 493144], [76, 493304]]}, {"verse": 72, "start": 494111, "end": 505891, "text": "And the second time the rooster crew. And Peter called to mind the word that Jesus said to him, Before the rooster crow twice, you shall deny me three times. And when he thought on it, he wept.", "words": [[0, 494111], [4, 494256], [8, 494356], [15, 494636], [20, 495016], [24, 495196], [32, 495576], [38, 496441], [42, 496570], [48, 496850], [55, 497210], [58, 497410], [63, 497650], [67, 497850], [72, 498110], [77, 498350], [83, 498670], [88, 499090], [91, 499290], [96, 499883], [103, 500112], [107, 500312], [115, 500672], [120, 500912], [127, 501732], [131, 501872], [137, 502072], [142, 502392], [145, 502612], [151, 502872], [158, 503955], [162, 504079], [167, 504219], [170, 504379], [178, 504639], [181, 504859], [185, 505179], [188, 505319]]}]}